WEBVTT

00:17:29.169 --> 00:17:31.880
Truly, I believe that we can.

00:17:32.964 --> 00:17:37.969
As long as we shed light
on our transition blind spots

00:17:37.969 --> 00:17:40.305
and take them as our guiding companions

00:17:40.305 --> 00:17:42.933
to identify what truly systemic,

00:17:42.974 --> 00:17:44.601
truly peaceful

00:17:44.601 --> 00:17:48.396
and truly safe solution pathways look like

00:17:48.438 --> 00:17:51.233
for the age of climate-disrupted futures.

00:17:52.025 --> 00:17:53.401
Thank you so much.

00:17:53.401 --> 00:17:57.280
(Applause)